  "$comment": "EXP-1154: the PR body = a TEXT projection of the run's Guide (EXP-1251, formerly Results) (apps/web lib/pr-body-from-results.ts). Text sections only (non-blank text, first text per topic, first-seen order, files cleaned like session-results.json files); null without one (the caller keeps its fallback). The first Summary (trimmed, case-insensitive) leads with no heading; every other topic = '### <topic>' (whitespace runs collapsed to one space; a trailing ' #' run's last '#' escaped as '\\\\#'), a blank line, its text; a section's files follow as '- `path`' bullets after a blank line (newlines stripped; the fence one backtick longer than the longest backtick run in the path, padded with a space when the path starts or ends with a backtick); sections join with a blank line; resultsUrl adds '\\n\\n---\\n\\n[Guide and screenshots in Exponential](<url>)'. Over max (default 60000) the sections cut at the last newline that fits and end in a '\\n…' line; the footer is always kept. Pictures are never embedded. EXP-1251 prUrl: a case may carry prUrl (the PR the body is for): a topic whose first text entry is tagged with ANOTHER prUrl is left out (untagged topics stay); prUrl null = untagged topics only; absent = no filter.",
